From e8740d08da5db5884c5a90371fb1d839075fdc56 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chhowm <chhowm@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 22:02:12 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Add a non-contact hover test at the predicted release
 point (G4 pre-check, no stone)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/robot/hover_predicted.py      | 211 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tools/robot/test_hover_predicted.py |  26 ++++
 2 files changed, 237 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 tools/robot/hover_predicted.py
